WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:04,020
พี่ชายใครพบส่วนแบ่งของพ่อ? บอกฉันความจริง

2
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:06,620
Who is looking for it? What can happen to the place that Master is optimistic about?

3
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:12,070
Brother, tell the truth, did you accept money from anyone?

4
00:00:12,070 --> 00:00:15,670
เกิดอะไรขึ้น? The old man is seeing his eldest grandson in a hurry for money.

5
00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:17,870
ไม่เช่นนั้นคุณจะตายในเวลานี้ได้ไหม?

6
00:00:17,870 --> 00:00:21,070
The old man feels sorry for his eldest grandson. Do we have any problems with using this money?

7
00:00:21,070 --> 00:00:23,070
คุณพูดอะไร? Are you still shameless?

8
00:00:23,070 --> 00:00:25,470
If you have money, you can give me some fans

9
00:00:25,470 --> 00:00:30,680
My mother passed away early and it was my brother who brought me up.

10
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:33,080
But after he got married, he seemed like a different person

11
00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:37,620
I don't know why he suddenly changed like this. ทำไม

12
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:39,420
Now I just want to move dad out

13
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:41,420
No, you can't move this one yet

14
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:42,420
ทำไม

15
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:44,820
You listen to me and I will give you a blessing

16
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:48,820
มันสามารถปกป้องคุณจากฝันร้ายได้ภายในหนึ่งปี และคุณจะไม่สามารถเคลื่อนไหวได้อีกหลังจากหนึ่งปี
